  "title": "Meatless Meatballs with Vegetable Sauce",
  "description": "Seasoned plant-based meatless meatballs are simmered in a hearty vegetable-based sauce in this easy vegetarian recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Uzo Orimalade"
  ],
